B.Yh=new A.aO(B.G,B.a7,7,"Home Row Review","Short phrases to lock in the home row.","a sad lad; a glad dad; ask dad; all fall; has a flask; had a salad; half a flag; a glass; a dash; a flask; a lass has a gas flask; dad had a salad; ask a lad;",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","","All eight fingers on the home row","Do not look down. If you lose your place, find the bumps on F and J again.")
