B.Y6=new A.aO(B.G,B.a7,17,"X and Period: Ring Fingers Down","Reach down with your ring fingers to X (left) and period (right).","..m xx xx ax xx txx .l xxx ..u ... ... mxx .x. xl ... .q. jxx six. fix. mix. exit. extra. expect. fox. tax. relax. exam. excuse. taxi. wax.",90,0,"Stage 3 \xb7 Bottom Row","x.","Left ring: X \xb7 Right ring: . (period)","X is below S and the period is below L.")
