B.XD=new A.aO(B.G,B.cT,42,"Accuracy Challenge","Type slowly and aim for 95% accuracy.",'Quietly, the quick zebra jumped over six wooden boxes. Seven brave judges examined fifty-two huge frozen jars. "Why, exactly?" asked Ms. Vaz. Perfect practice makes progress.',95,0,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.s)
B.YK=new A.aO(B.G,B.cT,43,"Speed Builder 1","Reach 15 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","We like to walk by the river in the morning. The air is cool and the birds sing in the trees. After a short rest, we drink tea and talk about our day.",90,15,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 15 WPM. Keep your eyes on the screen.")
B.YH=new A.aO(B.G,B.cT,44,"Speed Builder 2","Reach 20 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","A good habit is built one day at a time. If you practise a little every day, your hands learn the path between the keys, and typing begins to feel as natural as walking.",90,20,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 20 WPM. Do not rush the hard words.")
B.YD=new A.aO(B.G,B.cT,45,"Speed Builder 3","Reach 25 WPM with at least 90% accuracy.","The best way to improve is to relax your shoulders, breathe, and let your fingers do the work. Fast typists are not tense; they are smooth. Smooth leads to fast, and fast follows when you stay calm.",90,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers","Target: 25 WPM. Smooth beats tense.")
B.Y0=new A.aO(B.G,B.cT,46,"Final Test","Show what you have learned: 25 WPM and 95% accuracy.","Touch typing is a skill that stays with you for life. Today you have learned every key, every finger, and how to keep a steady rhythm. Keep practising, keep your accuracy high, and your speed will continue to grow week after week.",95,25,"Stage 8 \xb7 Speed & Accuracy","","All ten fingers",u.W)
